# 统一换行符：仓库内一律存 LF，检出时 Windows 自动转 CRLF。
# 避免 CRLF/LF 混杂导致的无意义全文件 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.pt binary
*.onnx binary
*.db binary
*.zip binary

# 小程序构建产物由 npm 生成，不入库
miniprogram/dist/
miniprogram/unpackage/
